#: source/release-notes/rl-2.11.md:1
msgid "Release 2.11 (2022-08-24)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.11.md:3
msgid ""
"`nix copy` now copies the store paths in parallel as much as possible "
"(again). This doesn't apply for the `daemon` and `ssh-ng` stores which copy "
"everything in one batch to avoid latencies issues."
msgstr ""
